      "name": "Marley Frontend",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "Marley Frontend 是运行在 Frappe/ERPNext/Healthcare 之上的自托管医疗 Web 应用，其床位管理页面把 Healthcare Service Unit 作为床位/房间单元，提供按服务单元类型分组的可视化床位看板，维护 Vacant/Occupied/Cleaning/Under Maintenance 状态，并支持预约入院、收治入院、转床和清洁完成等操作；同仓库的 Python 后端方法负责床位查询、状态回写、入院与转床。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/earthians/marley_frontend",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/earthians/marley_frontend",
