      },
      "features": [
        "可视化床位/房间看板，按服务单元类型分组展示",
        "床位状态：Vacant、Occupied、Cleaning、Under Maintenance",
        "预约入院、收治入院、转床、清洁完成与状态回写",
        "按床位、房型、患者、状态和日期筛选",
        "与 Frappe Healthcare 的 Inpatient Record / Healthcare Service Unit 数据联动"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "作为 Frappe app 通过 bench get-app 安装并部署到自托管站点",
        "依赖 Frappe v16、ERPNext v16、Healthcare v16、MariaDB/Redis"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Vue 3",
        "Frappe UI / Vite",
        "Python (Frappe)",
        "Socket.IO"
      ],
